# Search for individual job postings published by {{company_name}} on {{careers_page}}

# Discovery Guidance
- You MUST construct search queries using: site:{{careers_page}} "{{positions}}"
- {{careers_page}} MAY be used only for discovery.
- Final results MUST clearly point to a single job posting URL.

# Strict Navigation Limitation
- Do NOT open individual job posting pages.
- Do NOT fetch or analyze job description content.
- Use only search result metadata, visible snippets, and URL structure.
- If verifying any constraint would require opening the job page, exclude the URL.

# Title Constraint
- The job title visible in search results metadata MUST contain one of:
{{positions}}

# Exclusions
- Do NOT return:
  - career homepages
  - listing pages
  - search result pages
  - selector pages
  - aggregator domains

# Final Requirement
- Include a job posting ONLY if all constraints can be verified from metadata alone.
- If metadata is insufficient, exclude the URL.
